  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/itssmudgy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/2a9df7a0-e76e-449b-89d8-e5c5422dead7.webp\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<section>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hVcqt4vzbu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons/webp/discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\"></a>ᅟ<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fitssmudgy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-F16061?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hEzgIwf.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h2>\n<p>此模組為 Cozary 開發的《ColoredWater》附加模組。本模組新增了彩色熔岩，讓您能隨心所欲地裝飾您的世界。此外，本模組還添加了「暗淡彩色熔岩」，這是一種不會發光的彩色熔岩變體。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_346af96c-245c-4a00-b713-df45a76df81c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p><strong>合成：</strong></p>\n<p>合成方式直觀且簡單。您只需準備一桶熔岩與一種染料。製作暗淡彩色熔岩時，只需額外添加一種染料！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a4827793-28cd-4808-b8bc-aa7fcc29dbb5.png\" width=\"381\" height=\"214\"></p>\n</div>\n</section>",
